add('green-beans','Garlic green beans','International','side',15,'green beans:300:g|garlic:3:clove|oil:15:ml|salt:1:g','Trim and wash green beans. Mince garlic.~Heat oil in a pan. Briefly stir garlic until fragrant, then add the beans.~Add salt and 60 ml water. Cover for 5–7 minutes until beans are tender-crisp.~Uncover and toss until the remaining liquid evaporates.')
